  "description": "Kim Sae-Rang, trapped in the quagmire of perfectionism, spots an annoying guy who catches her eye: Baek Eun-Jae, a classmate from the same department.\n\n *“Ugh... I don’t like this guy.”*\n\nThings have been rocky from the very first meeting... Will I ever be able to get along with him?\n\nA fresh, foodie romance between art students whose tastes—from favorite foods to personal preferences—are complete opposites.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
